{
  "id": "MAT.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Matayo 9",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okogwenia omonto orenge rigata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 2:1-12; Luk 5:17-26)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agasoa obwato, akaamboka, agaika omochie oye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na rigereria, bakamorentera omonto orenge rigata, oraire borere; na, ekero Yeso achia korora okwegena kwabo, agateebia oria rigata, “Remia enkoro, omwana one, ebibe biao biabeirwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na rora, abande ase aborokia b’amariiko bakaboora ase emioyo yabo, “Omonto oyo ’nkorama are Nyasae.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Yeso namanyete ebirengererio biabo, akababoria, “Nase ki inwe mokorengereria ebirengererio ebibe ase chinkoro chiaino?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiriri rire riango, goteeba: Ebibe biao biabeirwe, gose goteeba: Imoka ogende?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende monyare komanya ng’a Omwana‐o‐Mwanyabaanto nare nokobua ase ense gw’okwabera ebibe.” Erio agwo agateebia oria orenge rigata, “Imoka, bwetweke egeseero",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ki’ao, ogende bwoo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaimoka, akagenda bwoye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emeganda egachia korora aya, bakooboa, bakamotogia Nyasae, oy’oete Mwanyabaanto okobua konga buna oko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okorangerigwa kwa Matayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 2:13-17; Luk 5:27-32)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yeso achia goeta korwa aroro akarora omonto oyomo okorokwa Matayo, oikaransete aase enyomba ekoruserigwa ebango, akamoteebia, “Ntunyana!” Akaimoka, akamotunyana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yeso aikaransire nyomba koragera, rora, abarusia ebango abange amo n’abanyabibe bagaacha, bagaikaransa amo na Yeso na aborokigwa baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abafarisai bachia korora aya, bakabooria aborokigwa baye, “Nase ki Omworokia oino akoria amo nabarusia ebango n’a banyabibe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agachia koyaigwa, akabateebia, “Abare buya tibari korigia omogwenia, otatiga abarwarete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genda mweorokererie engencho yaye ninki: Inche nigo ndigetie amaabera, gose tari ekeng’wanso. Inaki tincheti korangeria abanyaboronge, korende abanyabibe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Riborio igoro y’okweng’ata",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 2:18-22; Luk 5:33-39)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ekio aborokigwa ba Yohana bakamochiera, bakamoboria, Nase ki intwe na Abafarisai tokweng’ata ekero ase ekero, ko aborokigwa bao tibari kweng’ata",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akabateebia, “Inee! Abarangerigwa b’enyangi inabanyare korera ekero omonywomi are amo nabarabwo? Korende amatuko nache, barache kourwa omonywomi; erio nario barache kweng’ata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onde tari okobeka ekeraka ki’egetambaa ekeyia ase eyanga engotu, ekiagera keria kiabekwa nigo kegotandora eyanga eria, na ase yatandogete ake nigo ekona‐gochiererera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose onde tari okobeeka edivai enyia ase ebirandi ebigotu biroisirie korwa ase amasankwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Eise kobekwa bo, ebirandi biria nigo biratandoke, na edivai eiteke, na ebirandi bisareke; korende edivai enyia nigo ekobekwa ase ebirandi ebiyia, bionsi bibere biasirana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omoiseke o Yairo na omokungu ore noborwaire bw’okorua amanyinga bakogwenigwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mar 5:21-43; Luk 8:40-56)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yeso are gokwana aya, omonene oyomo agacha, akabeeka amaru inse asare, okobora, “Omwana one omoiseke okuure bono iga, korende inchwo aye, omobekere okoboko, na ere nabe moyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akaimoka agatunyana omonto oria, ere na aborokigwa baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na rora, omokungu oyomo oyorenge noborwaire bw’okorua amanyinga ase engaki y’emiaka ikomi na ebere, akamochiera korwa magega, agakuna omokoba bw’eyanga yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo arengereretie ase omoyo oye ime, “Inse gokuna eyanga yaye, ningwene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akeonchora, akamorora, akamoteebia, “Moiseke one, remia enkoro; okwegena kwao gwakogwenirie.” Omokungu oria akagwena erio kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso agachia gosoa enyomba y’omonto oria omonene, akarora ababugia ebiroria, na abanto basangererekaneteo bakorera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabateebia, “Karuo aa! Omoiseke oyo takweti, okorara araire gwoka.” Bakamosekerera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekero baria basangererekanete amo basogetigwe isiko, agasoa ime, akamobwata okoboko, na omoiseke oria akaimoka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana aya agasarera ase ense eria yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okogwenia abanto babere emeuko",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Yeso arenge goeta korwa aase aria, abanto babere barenge emeuko bakamotunyana, bagaaka eriogi, bakaboora, “Tororere amaabera, aye omwana o Daudi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso agachia gosoa nyomba, emeuko eria ekamochiera. Yeso akababoria, “Inee! Mwegenire ng’a inche ninyare gokora ring’ana eri?” Bakamoteebia, “Ee, Omonene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agwo agakuna amaiso abo, akabateebia, “Abe ase more koreng’ana nokwegena kwaino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaiso abo akaramokigwa. Yeso akabatianera bokong’u, “Rigereria monto onde tabaisa komanya amang’ana aya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende barabwo bagasoka isiko, bagasareria amang’ana aye ase ense eria yonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okogwenia omonto orenge rimama, naende obwatire nekerecha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero bachia gosoka isiko, rora, abanto bakamorentera omonto orenge rimama, naende nigo ere abwatire nekerecha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ekerecha giachia goserigwa, omonto oria rimama agakwana. Emeganda egakumia, ekabora, “Amang’ana anga buna aya tana kororekana nonya ng’ake ase Abaisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Abafarisai bakaboora, “Ere nase chinguru chi’omonene bw’ebirecha agoseria ebirecha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso agaetanana emechie yonsi na ebinyoro, okworokereria ase chisinagogi chiabo, okorandia amang’ana amaya y’oborwoti na kogwenia amarwaire onsi na oboreu bwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okororera abanto amabeebe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agachia korora emeganda y’ abanto, akabarorera amabeebe, ekiagera konya bachandekire, baserebekanire buna ching’ondi chitari nomorisia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agateebia aborokigwa baye, “Rigesa nerinene, korende abakori emeremo nabake;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaki mosabe Omonene bwe rigesa atome abakori emeremo ase rigesa riaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.9.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
